5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. Let us keep a calm mind as we begin this.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I hope we can find the truth together.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical approach. Let's establish how we will handle the first few days.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm ready! Should we just start guessing, or wait for some clues?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Rushing is a mistake. I suggest we observe each other's reactions for a while first.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Shion. Observation is the safest path for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"If that is what everyone prefers, I am happy to go along with it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Observation is fine, but we shouldn't be too passive. We need a plan for Day 1.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"But if we wait too long, the werewolf just keeps attacking! We need to be proactive.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Proactivity without evidence is just gambling, Kenji. We should be more calculating.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Perhaps we can look for inconsistencies in how people argue.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,That sounds like a very gentle way to find the answer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,Exactly. I will be looking for any logical gaps in your statements.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll be watching everyone closely too! I'll find the wolf!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm is noted, but try not to let it cloud your judgment.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
