31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The first night has passed. Does anyone have anything they wish to share?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I feel a bit anxious, but I trust you all.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We have no deaths yet, but we have the first day's vote. We need a lead.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I have a lead! Shion is the werewolf! I know it!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That was fast. @Kenji, you're claiming to be the Seer? That's a very bold move.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,A Seer revealing themselves so early is unusual. It's a high-risk strategy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, such a strong accusation so soon. Are you sure, Kenji?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, why are you revealing your role immediately? It makes you a target for the wolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Because we can win right now! Why wait for more people to die?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,Or perhaps he's the Possessed trying to frame me to gain trust. It's a classic play.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,Shion's point is logical. A real Seer might wait to gather more data.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I don't want to cause conflict, but we must be careful who we believe.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"If Kenji is the Seer, the wolf is found. If he's lying, he's the enemy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not lying! Shion is the wolf! Please, just trust me!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, you value logic. Does it seem logical for a Seer to be this impulsive?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I find Kenji's urgency suspicious. I'm leaning toward Shion's caution.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will follow the group's consensus. It is hard to decide.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"The risk of executing a Villager is high, but Kenji's certainty is absolute. I'll trust the claim.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Thank you, Asuka! Let's vote Shion out!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,You are all making a grave mistake. I am merely a human observing this chaos.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
